{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣藝人范植偉曾拍攝過不少電影作品，包括《美麗時光》、《淚王子》以及電視劇《孽子》等。</p><p>當年憑着斯文的形象和文青氣質，加上精湛演技火速走紅，更被視為「小梁朝偉」美譽。</p><p>近年鮮少在公開場合露面的他，近日現身金馬影展觀影，最新近況光惹關注。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T20:21:18.407782+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T20:01:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T20:14:36.167066+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T20:14:36.167066+00:00","content_hash":"fcf4bf4d3d021e60d3fa68692ee253a8731ec943e6a85a29a3ba671036165586","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}